---
import Reveal from '../react/Reveal';
---

<section id="contatti" data-snap class="section-pad scroll-mt-20 bg-cream py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
    <Reveal client:visible className="lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.52rem)] leading-tight text-terracotta">
        <p>Prima si osserva.</p>
        <p>Si comprende il contesto,</p>
        <p>si definisce una direzione.</p>
        <p>
          Il{' '}
          <span class="font-script text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem)] leading-none text-olive">design</span>{' '}
          è la conseguenza.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Reveal>

    <Reveal client:visible delay={0.1} className="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand lg:col-span-5">
      <img
        src="/images/relais.png"
        alt="Relais con luce naturale"
        class="aspect-553/225 w-full object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <p class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[2px] text-cream/70">
        Relais
      </p>
    </Reveal>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-site border-t border-sand/50 pt-12 md:mt-24 md:pt-16">
    <Reveal client:visible className="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <p class="text-xl text-taupe">Inizia una conversazione.</p>
      <a
        href="mailto:studio@mirianastudio.it"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[2px] text-olive transition-opacity hover:opacity-70"
      >
        studio@mirianastudio.it
        <span class="inline-block h-px w-8 bg-ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>
    </Reveal>
  </div>
</section>
